# AIWS OS developer toolchain: Debian 13 (trixie) 'main' only. Every name below was checked against the real
# trixie package index (see os/debian/tools/check_packages.py). Compilers already present in aiws-desktop.list.chroot
# (python3, nodejs, npm, golang-go, rustc, cargo, openjdk-21-jdk, maven, clang, cmake, ninja-build, gdb, strace,
# ripgrep, fd-find, jq) are not repeated. NOT available in Debian main, so NOT included: .NET SDK, pnpm, black, ruff
# (install them per user with pipx/npm/Microsoft's feed if needed). The full profile only: the smoke profile drops this list.

# Languages and language tooling
ruby
ruby-dev
php-cli
lua5.4
node-typescript
python3-dev

# Build systems
meson
pkg-config
make
g++

# Databases (clients only)
sqlite3
postgresql-client

# Debugging, analysis, linting, formatting
valgrind
clangd
clang-format
shellcheck
shfmt
universal-ctags
pylint
mypy
flake8
python3-pytest
hyperfine

# Git and code review helpers
git-lfs
gh
git-delta
tig

# Terminal productivity
tmux
vim
neovim
nano
fzf
bat
tree
htop
btop
direnv
httpie
less
file
man-db
